  "pack_markdown": "# Blindspot Courier — Interaction Wireframe Pack v0.3\\n\\nFun promise: rotate the view to deliberately create unseen space and use that blindspot as a delivery corridor.\\n\\nFlow: Stage Select → Stage Intro → Gameplay → Result; Gameplay ↔ Pause. Failure retries from stage-start snapshot.\\n\\nCore: stationary planning supports camera rotation and node-route tracing; movement locks edits and checks detection node-by-node; pickup/delivery updates cargo.\\n\\nVariations: static/active-rotation watchers, wall LOS, overlapping sectors, route branching, multiple parcels.\\n\\nGodot architecture remains Implementation Blueprint responsibility.",
  "source_run_at": "2026-09-30T17:33:28.26286+00:00",
  "target_device": "mobile",
  "global_ui_rules": {
    "fun_promise": "화면을 돌려 보지 않는 곳을 의도적으로 만들고 그 사각지대를 배송 통로로 쓴다.",
    "decision_origin": "wireframe_layout",
    "feedback_priority": [
      "detection",
      "freeze/wake",
      "route",
      "cargo"
    ]
